(text "1  DRV5032FA: omnipolar, push-pull output, 20 Hz sampling, BOP max 4.8 mT (TI DRV5032 datasheet).\n   Push-pull output needs no pull-up, so the Jetson J12 >50 kOhm pull rule is met with none fitted.\n2  OUT goes low while either magnet pole is within range; idle high.\n3  Sensor face (branded side of SOT-23) points at the Earth-ring magnet.\n4  C1 per TI: >= 0.1 µF ceramic from VCC to GND, close to the device." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b4608239-cf10-557f-9af6-8933f6c14e90"))
